{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50e21511822f355fa4cc99ddc0b610f45e0cd859a0b819de9ad40b92c7224585", "ja": "（今日は、恵美たちが出演するPVの撮影。\nオリエンタルな衣装のベリーダンスは、圧巻だったな）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄惠美她们出演的PV。\n穿着东方风格服装跳的肚皮舞，真是让人大开眼界啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "f8297efc49ccd6861ef2f098a58de8fae9a62b4bec46bd8f74b4674b2668d2a4", "ja": "今日の撮影、楽しかった～！\nダンスがバシッと決まると、気持ちいいよね♪", "zh": "今天的拍摄，好开心啊～！\n舞蹈干脆利落地完成时，感觉真棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "322ce941d35d71a80a4d8c787ebf5d1268d83514905f9b923227402be6084394", "ja": "うん、いいPVになりそうだよ。恵美は自分の練習も\nあったのに、静香のサポートもしてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "嗯，感觉能拍出一部很棒的PV呢。惠美明明自己\n也要练习，还帮了静香那么多，谢谢你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "71855845bf59bd830a6603cd410f7078d097108ccedf8b70fffc433c0e6ed499", "ja": "そう？　なんか、ストレートにほめられると\n照れるなー……にゃははっ。", "zh": "是吗？被这样直白地夸奖，还真让人不好意思啊……呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "aea6d9306274dd1943e98d7de25dc9e9dec99c36f43266b2d9b8dcac621684d6", "ja": "でもどうせなら、がんばったご褒美に、\n新しいマニキュアとかほしいな～？　なんて。へへっ。", "zh": "不过既然这样，我倒是想要新的指甲油，作为努力过后的奖励～？嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e022239d4693020d493b512f3a6a38949210624a231c74cd8cbf94a9516169cc", "ja": "マニキュアか……今回は、大活躍だったからな。\nそのくらい、お安いご用だよ。", "zh": "指甲油啊……这次你可是大显身手了。\n这点小事，当然没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "21ec94e2b07bbd8d8c53ab16f7849edeb6b9146e5e1d4cd84ec5ba155742bfef", "ja": "えっ！？　い、いやいや、\n冗談だってば、{$P$}！", "zh": "欸！？不、不是啦，我开玩笑的嘛，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "f95a776b3446575462849d2742c8c42b33a098674f81e71edb48f4990882de09", "ja": "それにアタシ、物がほしくてがんばったわけじゃ\nないしさ……ベリーダンス、けっこう楽しかったし。", "zh": "而且我也不是为了想要东西才努力的嘛……肚皮舞还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "0589fda8b400c28641ac2e11c0c59ff5493cf92cbc78b1dea1617b58ce24aeee", "ja": "それより、ほめるなら静香をほめてあげてよ！\n今回、すっごくがんばってたからさ。", "zh": "比起夸我，你还是夸夸静香吧！这次她真的特别努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "83237facc157c7512d87bff9c1d9c9bed5430d6422abcad8457b6c519a9fdaaf", "ja": "そうか？　……あ、そうそう。\n静香といえば、恵美にって手紙を預かったんだ。", "zh": "是吗？……啊，对了。\n说到静香，我替她收了一封要交给你的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "d3c808a530a4ae5958ae196daf81b269df7a01f2dbe4fbd862ec8064f65904b1", "ja": "えっ、手紙？　静香が、アタシに？", "zh": "咦，信？静香托人交给我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_1011", "source_sha256": "bb2b95d755c4da4db33b78d29709f4fa133f9e85f787dbf0a13f3840684f7a11", "ja": "手紙を渡す", "zh": "交付信件", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2000_p", "source_sha256": "491b7e8dd34e63e1a05f8ba74c81407b9d04c15bda363b8378460b98473acfda", "ja": "ああ。今時、手書きの手紙なんて珍しいけど……\nこういうのも、たまには悪くないな。", "zh": "啊。现在亲手写信可是很少见了，不过……\n偶尔这样一次，也挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2001_020meg", "source_sha256": "36f72393660d885d62176859ea2d8e1d1bdd59a3b061583f5661ba4bb6d73d9a", "ja": "ホントだよね～。メールすればすむのに、\n静香ってば、そういうとこ真面目なんだから……。", "zh": "真的呢～明明发邮件就能解决，静香真是的，在这种地方就是太认真了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2002_020meg", "source_sha256": "a7b8e9aeacbcc024e8c3dd5b6f80430793d0ed5b79bd0fd47579ebd393c5999e", "ja": "えーと、なになに？　『恵美さん、今回はたくさん\n練習に付き合ってくれて、ありがとうございました』", "zh": "那个，写了什么？“惠美姐，这次陪我练了这么多次，真的非常感谢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2003_020meg", "source_sha256": "5c182fb1556dd3c69467831a990bd5404bc41f279114ccd04cd5ddeac90577f6", "ja": "『最初は、こんな衣装で踊るなんて絶対ムリ！って\n思ったけど、恵美さんのおかげで楽しく踊れました』", "zh": "『一开始，我还觉得穿着这样的服装跳舞绝对不行！不过多亏了惠美姐，我跳得很开心』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c2b0c798f160b364ddcf045f061ed3849d2b1650e149cb199202b3d8f4f87127", "ja": "そうか。よかったな、恵美。", "zh": "这样啊。太好了，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2005_020meg", "source_sha256": "e32508c434f56f82dbf299bd8215abcb92a3ffc811d17bef26f4e4e38dd45a7e", "ja": "にゃははっ……そっかそっか……\nでもさ、こういうことされると……うう……。", "zh": "呀哈哈……这样啊这样啊……\n不过，被这样对待的话……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2006_p", "source_sha256": "d83ae87b7c9f9c0561c20872db438a37894eda7f746108b238aaa63c62ff2a53", "ja": "恵美？", "zh": "惠美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2007_020meg", "source_sha256": "b07982095ec295cc197f6d9ffa3d7e0c67b858b347d726092c62c0f6b44da3d7", "ja": "ご、ごめん{$P$}。\nなんか、思ってたより泣けてきちゃった……。", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}。\n不知怎么的，哭得比想象中还厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2008_020meg", "source_sha256": "c0403500f7887d91b9461b674a2384a4eb8be8a25accdb280bd976e53b1b0392", "ja": "こんなふうに手紙もらうとか、思ってなかったからさ。\nなんか、うれしくて……あはは。", "zh": "因为没想到会收到这样的信嘛。就是觉得有点开心……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2009_020meg", "source_sha256": "e47ad25a0baa8eb1b5e5170e59aad564ad9f4b8247b8e2b7e254bba43b4d73a9", "ja": "あ、えっと……\nさっきのごほうびって、まだ有効かな？", "zh": "啊，那个……\n刚才说的奖励，还有效吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2010_p", "source_sha256": "12ad40b8ccf3b8ca8670c0e48d503548d5ace13bb113830f583fe51e2b8688b2", "ja": "もちろん。何にするんだ？", "zh": "当然。你想要什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0154_2011_020meg", "source_sha256": "762c85eb5bd2c8404a62450b3df2822c320f567c4c370a2d3c7750fe0bb0d159", "ja": "レターセット！　めっちゃカワイイやつ！\nそれで、静香に返事、書かないとだからね♪", "zh": "信纸套装！要特别可爱的那种！\n因为得用它给静香回信嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
